| `PYTEST_XDIST_WORKER` | string; dynamic | unset: `main`; pytest-xdist sets it in each worker | a worker id such as `gw0` | `tests/isolation_guard.py` (`child_scratch_root`), called by `tests/conftest.py` `child_scratch` | Names the child scratch root a test process hands its nested pytest sessions, `children-<worker id>` under the session root, so sessions started from different workers never share one `pytest-of-<user>`. | choosing which tests a worker runs: pytest-xdist's `-n` and `--dist` | always |
